    {
      "duration_ms": 10500,
      "caption": "ARM64 has four privilege levels: EL0 user, EL1 kernel, EL2 hypervisor, EL3 secure monitor.",
      "narration": "Higher number means more privilege. Applications run at EL0, the operating system kernel at EL1, a hypervisor at EL2, and the secure monitor firmware at EL3.",
